flowchart LR
  subgraph Client
    CAM[Camera] --> MP[MediaPipe Hands/Pose]
    MP --> FE[Feature vector<br/>63-D or 258-D]
  end
  subgraph Backend [Python FastAPI]
    FE -->|WebSocket| ROUTER[Mode Detector]
    ROUTER -->|stillness| LET[Letter MLP<br/>ASL or ArSL]
    ROUTER -->|motion| WORD[Word BiLSTM<br/>ASL or ArSL]
    LET --> DEC1[Letter-Stream Decoder]
    WORD --> DEC2[Word Decoder]
    DEC1 --> RESP[JSON response]
    DEC2 --> RESP
  end
  subgraph UI
    RESP --> WEB[React Web App]
    RESP --> MOB[React Native App]
  end
  subgraph Auth [Node Express]
    WEB <-->|JWT| AUTH[Auth and Chat]
    MOB <-->|JWT| AUTH
  end
